title: "Hybrid Deep Learning + NDVI Threshold for High-Resolution Urban Greenspace Classification (Code)"
abstract: >
  Reference implementation for a hybrid deep learning and NDVI-threshold
  approach to high-resolution urban greenspace classification. This repository
  accompanies the Urban Forestry & Urban Greening article listed under
  'preferred-citation' and is released for noncommercial academic use.
